  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Panpsych** (1 other source): Lyrics for this track were altered to include the phrase \"Panpsych, fuck yeah\" [1]\n- **Silent Spirit** (1 other source): The performance of this song included a false start before the main take [1]\n- **Grow Wings and Fly** (1 other source): Extra lyrics about the band pissing themselves were added to this song [1]\n- **Theia** (1 other source): Rock arrangement featured teases for Vomit Coffin, Land Before Timeland, and Sharp Dressed Man [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Phantom Island**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Deadstick**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Lonely Cosmos**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Eternal Return**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Panpsych**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Spacesick**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Aerodynamic**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Sea of Doubt**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-08-06.ravinia** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 133 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Chicago Philharmonic conducted by Sarah Hicks joined the band for this performance [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-08-06.ravinia**: taped by Anonymous; source: AT831 > R-07 > 24/96 WAV > microSD [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by The Pavilion at Ravinia: [King Gizzard & The Lizard Wizard With The National Symphony Orchestra Tickets | 6 August 2025 | Ravinia Pavilion](https://www.highlandparkpavilion.com/events/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-with-the-national-symphony-orchestra-06-august-2025/) [4]\n- Poster by WONDERVAULTS: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Ravinia Festival 2025 Event In Highland Park Illinois On August 6 2025 T-shirt,Sweate](https://legendwearco.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-ravinia-festival-2025-event-in-highland-park-illinois-on-august-6-2025-t-shirt/) [5]",
